      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for lua51-luajit",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for lua51-luajit fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2024-25176: Fixed stack-buffer-overflow in lj_strfmt_wfnum in lj_strfmt_num.c (bsc#1246077)\n- CVE-2024-25177: Fixed unsinking of IR_FSTORE for NULL metatable (bsc#1246078)\n- CVE-2024-25178: Fixed ut-of-bounds read in the stack-overflow handler in lj_state.c (bsc#1246079)\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "details",
        "text": "SUSE-2025-2886,openSUSE-SLE-15.6-2025-2886",
